                                "sense_id": "a97ad482-c52c-3af5-bf52-faece2e92583",
                                "text": "If Rodriguez slumps and the Yankees stumble, pressure will mount on a manager who failed to guide the team to the playoffs in 2008, the first time the Yankees missed the postseason in a nonstrike year since 1993."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bbd75e8e-5f90-486f-b33b-6fc33480a0b1",
                                "sense_id": "a97ad482-c52c-3af5-bf52-faece2e92583",
                                "text": "Suárez has only two more starts in the regular season to convince the Phillies he deserves a longer leash than in previous postseasons."
                            }
